}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx882\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 O gracious and everliving God, you have created us male and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 female in your image: Look mercifully upon this man and this\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 woman who come to you seeking your blessing, and assist\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 them with your grace, that with true fidelity and steadfast love\par
