}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 If Communion is to follow, the Lord{\u8217\'92}s Prayer may be omitted here}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Deacon or other person appointed reads the following prayers, to\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 which the People respond, saying, Amen}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 .}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 If there is not to be a Communion, one or more of the prayers may \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 be omitted.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Let us pray.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Eternal God, creator and preserver of all life, author of \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 salvation, and giver of all grace: Look with favor upon the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 world you have made, and for which your Son gave his life,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and especially upon this man and this woman whom you\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 make one flesh in Holy Matrimony. }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Give them wisdom and devotion in the ordering of their\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 common life, that each may be to the other a strength in need, a \softline
counselor in perplexity, a comfort in sorrow, and a companion in joy.  \softline
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Grant that their wills may be so knit together in your will,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and their spirits in your Spirit, that they may grow in love\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and peace with you and one another all the days of their life.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Give them grace, when they hurt each other, to recognize and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 acknowledge their fault, and to seek each other{\u8217\'92}s forgiveness\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and yours.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Make their life together a sign of Christ{\u8217\'92}s love to this sinful\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and broken world, that unity may overcome estrangement, forgiveness \softline
heal guilt, and joy conquer despair.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Bestow on them, if it is your will, the gift and heritage of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 children, and the grace to bring them up to know you, to love you, \softline
and to serve you.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Give them such fulfillment of their mutual affection that they\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 may reach out in love and concern for others.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
