\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Grant that all married persons who have witnessed these vows\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 may find their lives strengthened and their loyalties\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 confirmed.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Grant that the bonds of our common humanity, by which all\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 your children are united one to another, and the living to the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 dead, may be so transformed by your grace, that your will may\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 be done on earth as it is in heaven; where, O Father, with your\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Son, and the Holy Spirit, you live and reign in perfect unity,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 now and for ever. }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3  Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs40 \f3\fs40 The Blessing of the Marriage}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl360\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs20\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The people remain standing. The husband and wife kneel, and the Priest\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 says one of the following prayers}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Most gracious God, we give you thanks for your tender love\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in sending Jesus Christ to come among us, to be born of a\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 human mother, and to make the way of the cross to be the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 way of life. We thank you, also, for consecrating the union of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 man and woman in his Name. By the power of your Holy\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Spirit, pour out the abundance of your blessing upon this\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 man and this woman. Defend them from every enemy. Lead\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 them into all peace. Let their love for each other be a seal\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 upon their hearts, a mantle about their shoulders, and a\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 crown upon their foreheads. Bless them in their work and in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 their companionship; in their sleeping and in their waking; in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 their joys and in their sorrows; in their life and in their death.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Finally, in your mercy, bring them to that table where your\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 saints feast for ever in your heavenly home; through Jesus\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Christ our Lord, who with you and the Holy Spirit lives and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 reigns, one God, for ever and ever.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 or this}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 O God, you have so consecrated the covenant of marriage\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 that in it is represented the spiritual unity between Christ\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and his Church: Send therefore your blessing upon these your\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 servants, that they may so love, honor, and cherish each other\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in faithfulness and patience, in wisdom and true godliness,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 that their home may be a haven of blessing and peace;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 through Jesus Christ our Lord, who lives and reigns with you\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and the Holy Spirit, one God, now and for ever.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The husband and wife still kneeling, the Priest adds this blessing}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 God the Father, God the Son, God the Holy Spirit, bless,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 preserve, and keep you; the Lord mercifully with his favor\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 look upon you, and fill you with all spiritual benediction and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 grace; that you may faithfully live together in this life, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in the age to come have life everlasting.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \b\f3 The Peace}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Celebrant may say to the people}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3222\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \tab The peace of the Lord be always with you.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 People}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \ul0 \tab And also with you.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The newly married couple then greet each other, after which greetings\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 may be exchanged throughout the congregation}{\plain \fs20 \f3\fs20 .\par
